WEBVTT

00:00:00.733 --> 00:00:01.956
Welcome to Prac360:

00:00:01.956 --> 00:00:05.496
the complete practice system for South African doctors.

00:00:05.496 --> 00:00:13.348
Your diary, patient files, consultations, billing, claims and accounts in one place, with AI that does the typing for you.

00:00:14.048 --> 00:00:16.362
Every morning starts on the Home Dashboard.

00:00:16.362 --> 00:00:22.495
Today's patients, what you billed and collected this month, and everything that needs your attention, at a glance.

00:00:25.249 --> 00:00:27.636
The diary is built for a busy front desk.

00:00:27.636 --> 00:00:34.216
Book in seconds, mark patients as arrived or in consultation with one click, and see who has not been billed yet.

00:00:34.216 --> 00:00:36.952
Oncology treatment chairs sit right next to it.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.911
Open a patient and everything is there:

00:00:41.911 --> 00:00:47.844
medical aid details, allergies, chronic medicines, previous visits, documents and the account.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:51.410
In the consultation, AI Scribe does the typing.

00:00:51.410 --> 00:01:01.756
With the patient's permission it listens, and fills in the history, the vital signs, the diagnosis with its ICD-10 code, and the plan, while you simply talk to your patient.

00:01:01.756 --> 00:01:02.952
You stay in control:

00:01:02.952 --> 00:01:04.686
you review, approve and sign.

00:01:08.603 --> 00:01:10.625
Signing the note creates the bill.

00:01:10.625 --> 00:01:18.710
Prac360 checks the codes before the claim leaves, sends it to the medical aid electronically, and shows its EDI status until it is paid.

00:01:19.561 --> 00:01:24.012
If a claim is rejected, it tells you why in plain words and helps you fix it.

00:01:24.012 --> 00:01:26.440
Then you re-send it by EDI with one click.

00:01:30.761 --> 00:01:39.271
Payments from medical aids are matched from the remittance, patient payments are captured in seconds, and statements and age analysis are always one click away.

00:01:39.972 --> 00:01:42.671
And whenever you need something, just ask Assist.

00:01:42.671 --> 00:01:47.408
Talk or type in your own words, and it does the work, or asks you when it is not sure.

00:01:51.975 --> 00:01:54.358
Every practice gets the core system.

00:01:54.358 --> 00:01:56.212
Then add only what you need:

00:01:56.212 --> 00:02:05.745
Assist and AI Scribe, stock and dispensing, hospital and wards, oncology, dental, the SAMA billing coach, advanced reports and priority support.

00:02:06.446 --> 00:02:11.868
Your data is protected with personal logins, two-step verification, roles and a full audit trail.

00:02:11.868 --> 00:02:15.055
And built-in training gets your whole team going quickly.

00:02:16.446 --> 00:02:17.026
Prac360.

00:02:17.026 --> 00:02:19.926
Less admin, more time for your patients.

00:02:19.926 --> 00:02:22.101
Book your personal demo today.

